
"smart_sources:2025-01-03 - Shooting range construction company sues City of Eagle.md": {"path":"2025-01-03 - Shooting range construction company sues City of Eagle.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"wfihfh","at":1785795030189},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1784827754805,"size":7863,"at":1785795030225,"hash":"wfihfh"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"##Shooting range construction company sues City of Eagle for nearly $400,000 in unpaid bills for foothills shooting range":[10,29],"##Shooting range construction company sues City of Eagle for nearly $400,000 in unpaid bills for foothills shooting range#{1}":[12,29],"##Project broken up into phases due to lack of funding":[30,51],"##Project broken up into phases due to lack of funding#{1}":[32,51],"##TRS: Eagle requested changes beyond contract scope, budget":[52,76],"##TRS: Eagle requested changes beyond contract scope, budget#{1}":[54,76]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev","target":"Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev","line":5},{"title":"80-acre shooting sports park on a 300-acre piece of land","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2022/11/09/you-asked-what-is-the-status-of-the-two-shooting-ranges-in-eagle/","line":22},{"title":"has no budget to complete the multiple firearm ranges envisioned for the park.","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2024/10/11/eagle-foothills-shooting/","line":22},{"title":"tok commercial 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/1ff51757-dd76-432e-9972-14e69faf18c1.gif","line":24,"embedded":true},{"title":"Idaho Lottery - 90 MM - 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/35da0207-4735-4f00-a726-8f11ae69e570.gif","line":36,"embedded":true},{"title":"Idaho","target":"Idaho","line":38},{"title":"BoiseDev House - OTT - Corwin","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/4f196fdd-409a-421a-b9e3-ab39d6ca3b18.png","line":46,"embedded":true},{"title":"A1 Heating - 2:1 - Beat the Heat","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/89752a40-7ebf-454b-9e1f-898264293d49.jpg","line":58,"embedded":true},{"title":"BoiseDev House - OTT - Commercial","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/8b916803-64e1-4279-a378-7e47d28a2871.png","line":68,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Shooting range construction company sues City of Eagle","source":"https://boisedev.com/news/2024/12/20/shooting-range-construction-company-sues-city-of-eagle-over-nearly-400000-in-unpaid-bills-for-foothills-shooting-range/","author":["[[Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev]]"],"published":"2025-01-03","created":"2026-07-23","description":"A local company that designs and builds shooting ranges says the City of Eagle didn’t hold up its end of the bargain on work to build a shooting range in the foothills. In mid-November, Eagle-based company TRS Range Services filed a lawsuit alleging breach of contract after the company said the City of Eagle had […]","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},